    "gate": "Qwen3-8B: gates/lossless_spec.py samples and gates/lossless_spec_compare.py adjudicates per prefix and position with exchangeable-label permutation tests and a Bonferroni cutoff. Gemma 4: gates/lossless_spec.py samples and gates/lossless_floor.py adjudicates the same test shape against a plain-versus-plain floor taken from a same-session same-arm pass pair, with the passes interleaved across fresh servers",
    "sampling": "temperature 1.0, top_p 0.95, top_k 50, n=256 samples per prefix, 16 generated tokens, three pinned prefixes",
